  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Curiosity won."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lance opened the video Miguel had sent."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The footage was shaky, filmed from inside a convenience store somewhere in Manila."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "People were running. Someone screamed. A man tackled another person to the ground."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "At first it looked like an ordinary fight."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Then the man on top bit into the other person's neck."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The video ended abruptly."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lance frowned."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fake videos were getting harder and harder to identify these days."
    },

    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Still... something about it felt wrong."
    },

